    "image_with_text_3DfKjP": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Rm6PF6": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "6D armrests for arm support in all",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_c4QHVf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>6D armrests for arm support in all</h3><p>The Sihoo Doro C500 leads the way with its advanced 6D armrests, allowing adjustment in six directions for truly personalised comfort. Whether you're typing, gaming, or relaxing, enjoy optimal arm support in any sitting position - helping you maintain healthy posture and full-body support throughout the day.</p>",
