      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_aDbrPk": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Wide-Angle 3D Headrest for Exceptional Neck Support",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_fFLU3g": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Wide-Angle 3D Headrest for Exceptional Neck Support</h3><p>Crafted from soft, touchable materials, the Sihoo Doro C500's wide-angle 3D headrest gently conforms to the natural curve of your neck, ensuring a tailored fit every time. With its generously sized, multi-directional surface, you can comfortably rest your head to the side, perfect for relaxation after long hours at work.</p>",
