          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Customisable Seat Depth for Tailored Comfort",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_idwjYB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Customisable Seat Depth for Tailored Comfort</h3><p>Easily adjust the Sihoo Doro C500's seat depth by up to 4cm to suit your leg length and sitting style. This feature ensures proper thigh support, promotes healthy circulation, and delivers comfort even during long hours of use.</p>",
