          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cloud-Like Softness",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_7jFwg6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Cloud-Like Softness</h3><p>The Sihoo Doro C500 uses a unique weaving technique that combines Italian velvet with DuPont TPEE for its mesh material. This blend provides exceptional elasticity, durability, pressure relief, and a luxuriously soft texture-making it a staple of lasting ergonomic quality.</p>",
