        "text_y9kRXC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Engineered for Durability and Certified Safety</h3><p>Crafted from premium materials and built to the highest standards, the Sihoo Doro C500 undergoes rigorous quality testing for lasting performance. Certified to Level 4 BIFMA standards, this ergonomic chair is built for years of reliable use, ensuring support and comfort without compromise.</p>",
